[38;2;124;124;124m- h_0 = H(0) = 1[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- h_1 = H(1) - 2h_0 = 4 - 2 = 2[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- h_2 = H(2) - 3h_0 - 2h_1 = 9 - 3 - 4 = 2[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- h_3 = H(3) - 4h_0 - 3h_1 - 2h_2 = 13 - 4 - 6 - 4 = -1[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mh_3 = -1 < 0, contradicting h_i ≥ 0. Therefore R is not Cohen-Macaulay. □[0m

